  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Equation of planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now we know that equation of plane passing through the planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now given it is passing through the points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;when passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>\\</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And when passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>So, point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And distance of point<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;from the plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>18</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p>"
  }
